// Part 2 DAG, exposure = HTN. Paste into https://dagitty.net (Model > Model code).
// Age=maternal age, Race=race/Hispanic origin, Edu=education, Pay=payment source (SES),
// Smoke0=pre-pregnancy smoking, HTN/DM=pre-pregnancy hypertension/diabetes, BMI=pre-pregnancy BMI,
// GA=gestational age, BW=birth weight (mediators), U=unmeasured causes of preterm birth and death.
// Shared model for HTN, DM, BMI and Smoke0 (edges into Smoke0 and Smoke0 -> BMI, DM added 23 Nov 2026).
dag {
HTN [exposure]
Death [outcome]
U [latent]
Age -> { Edu Parity Smoke0 BMI HTN DM Death }
Race -> { Edu Pay Smoke0 BMI HTN DM Death }
Nativity -> { Edu Smoke0 BMI HTN Death }
Edu -> { Pay Smoke0 BMI Death }
Pay -> { Smoke0 HTN DM Death }
Parity -> { Smoke0 BMI HTN Death }
Smoke0 -> { BMI HTN DM GA BW Death }
BMI -> { HTN DM GA Death }
Year -> { BMI HTN DM Death }
HTN -> { GA BW Death }
DM -> { GA BW Death }
U -> { GA Death }
GA -> { BW Death }
BW -> Death
}
